      "author_handle": "stace35",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 16 years 11 months ago",
      "body": "Hi all\nIm currently 7 weeks pregnant but keep getting pains. They feel just like period pains, horrible and achy and they come and go only lasting a couple of seconds. Has anyone else had this before?",
